type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、よろしくです♬\n呼び捨てにしてみちゃいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、告知やら\n他にも趣味ブログ\n12枚目の活動も始まるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、改めてブログ書きますo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パジャマ\n頭にアイマスクです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2015/07/24/4092055/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都で前回のストライプパジャマか\n今回のアイスパジャマ着ようかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2015/07/24/4092055/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服迷い中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分アイスパジャマかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、全国握手会京都は\n生駒様とペア\n決まったときに\n生駒様に\nよろしくお願い致します\n連絡しちゃったすごく嬉しいな♬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくわくです♬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒さんのファンの皆様\n寺田蘭世です\n自己紹介等前回のブログでも\nしているので見て下さっていたら\n有難いなo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブも頑張ります♬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、ブログ書きます\n失礼しますo(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ranze.terada/img/blog/ranze.terada/img/2015/07/24/4092055/0002.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-26851":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"bre